title: Day1
---
<<declare $player_name = "Hero" as string>>
<<declare $player_health = 100 as number>>
<<declare $has_key = false as bool>>
<<declare $quest_stage = 0 as number>>

Alex: Hey, are you two ready for the project meeting?
Maya: I am. I spent most of last night organizing our notes.
Leo: Same here. I also prepared a rough prototype to show everyone.
Alex: Great. Let's see how far we can take this idea.

===

title: Day2
---
Maya: The professors seemed interested in our concept.
Leo: Yeah, but they want a clearer gameplay loop.
Alex: That's fair. We still have a lot of details to figure out.
Maya: At least we're moving in the right direction.

===

title: Day3
---
Leo: I finished the first playable version today.
Alex: Already? That's faster than I expected.
Maya: Let me try it.
Maya: The controls feel good, but the objectives are unclear.
Leo: I'll work on improving the tutorial.

===

title: Day4
---
Alex: We received feedback from the test players.
Maya: Mostly positive feedback, which is encouraging.
Leo: They also found several bugs.
Alex: Then our next priority is stability before adding new features.

===

title: Day5
---
Maya: I started creating concept art for the environment.
Leo: The sketches look amazing.
Alex: They really help define the game's atmosphere.
Maya: I'll prepare more variations tomorrow.

===

title: Day6
---
Leo: Bad news. The inventory system broke after the latest update.
Alex: How serious is it?
Leo: Players can't pick up items anymore.
Maya: Let's focus on fixing that before anything else.
Leo: Agreed.

===

title: Day7
---
Alex: The inventory issue is finally resolved.
Leo: Thankfully. That bug was harder than expected.
Maya: At least we learned a lot while fixing it.
Alex: Progress is progress.

===

title: Day8
---
Maya: We have a presentation next week.
Leo: Then we should prepare a polished demo.
Alex: I'll handle the slides.
Maya: I'll collect screenshots and artwork.
Leo: And I'll make sure the build is stable.

===

title: Day9
---
Leo: The demo build is complete.
Maya: Nice work.
Alex: Let's do one final test session.
Leo: Hopefully we won't discover any new issues.
Maya: Don't jinx it.

===

title: Day10
---
Alex: Presentation day has finally arrived.
Maya: I'm nervous, but excited.
Leo: We've worked hard for this.
Alex: No matter the outcome, we built something together.
Maya: Let's give it our best.
Leo: Let's go.

===